qwen3-coder-next` |\n| Experimental | `minimax.minimax-m2.5` |\n\nThat gives us what we wanted: **we are no longer hostage to one vendor subscription running out of credits.**\n\n### Keep these as later action items\n\nNo need to touch them tonight:\n\n1. Nova/classic Runtime quota request.\n2. Exact per-model context/output limits.\n3. Verify actual shorthand aliases.\n4. Cost telemetry/calibration.\n5. Test the remaining promising Mantle inventory selectively.\n6. Revisit the `$1` zero-spend budget so a healthy use of the $159.26 credit doesn't generate misleading budget noise.\n\nI would **not change the working bridge now**. We have a reversible, proven baseline. From here, we use it and harden incrementally rather than continuing to fiddle with something that is finally working.", "text_chars": 3719, "code_blocks": 6, "links": ["https://bedrock-mantle.us-east-2.api.aws/v1"], "citations": ["https://bedrock-mantle.us-east-2.api.aws/v1"], "path_references": ["AGENTS.md", "GCE_SEAT_ROUTER.md", "auth.json"], "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "has_voice_metadata": false, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "c3a29525-d402-4632-998a-690f73abf24b", "role": "assistant", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1790218216.836707, "updated_at": null, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "model_editable_context", "part_kinds": [], "text": "", "text_chars": 0, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "has_voice_metadata": false, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "fc3c892d-17f8-4add-a3a5-6b6f4256a684", "role": "assistant", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1790218222.550539, "updated_at": null, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "reasoning_recap", "part_kinds": [], "text": "", "text_chars": 0, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "has_